// Gallia County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Auditor's Pivot Point
// site, the Board of Elections, Courts Online and the River Cities news page)
// were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The county portal moved to galliacountyoh.gov; gallianet.net redirects there.
//     The Auditor (Pivot Point) is still at auditor.gallianet.net.
//   * galliacounty.org is the Gallia County Chamber of Commerce, not county
//     government.
//   * The Gallipolis Daily Tribune site (mydailytribune.com) is broken; local news
//     now runs as the River Cities Tribune & Register on wvnews.com, which the
//     county links.
//   * Woodland Centers merged into Hopewell Health Centers in 2018.
//   * The French Art Colony now links its own site instead of the visitors bureau
//     page.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Point Pleasant and Gallipolis Ferry are in Mason County, West Virginia
//   (Pleasant Valley Hospital, Valley Health). Vinton COUNTY vs the village of
//   Vinton; Centerville in Montgomery County; Rio Grande TX/NM.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Gallipolis, the seat), villages Rio Grande (has a site),
//     Centerville, Cheshire, Crown City and Vinton (no sites), and 15 townships (no
//     sites; officials listed on the county Trustees page).
//   * Two school districts (Gallipolis City, Gallia County Local); Buckeye Hills
//     Career Center serves Gallia, Jackson and Vinton. Mental health is the
//     Gallia-Jackson-Meigs ADAMH Board.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Gallipolis Municipal Court (gmcourt.org) and the Gallia-Meigs Community Action
//     Agency site: neither loads.
//   * Gallia-Vinton ESC, Board of DD, land bank, solid waste district, Metropolitan
//     Housing Authority, historical society: no websites found.
//   * WXBW 101.5 (licensed to Gallipolis): no station website found.

